{"method":"GET","url":"http://host.docker.internal:20999/v1/models","proxy_url":"ftp://127.0.0.1:21"}

### step 4: POST http://127.0.0.1:8397/v0/management/api-call (explicit direct bypass)
POST /v0/management/api-call HTTP/1.1
Host: 127.0.0.1:8397
User-Agent: curl/8.7.1
Accept: */*
Authorization: Bearer oracle-mgmt-key-1
